    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harrington is pleased to present this four-bedroom semi-detached home, offering generous living space, an integrated garage and a spacious rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor opens into an entrance hall with a separate living room featuring a fireplace and fitted shelving. To the rear, a bright kitchen with a central island flows into the dining area, where glazed doors open onto the garden. A guest WC completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are four bedrooms and a family bathroom. Outside, the rear garden combines a lawn with a decked seating area, while the front driveway provides off-street parking. The garage offers useful storage and is currently set up as a home gym.\r\n\r\nWith flexible accommodation and outdoor space for family life or entertaining, 42 Crotanstown is a home with plenty to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nWelcoming hallway with staircase to the first floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room — 4.14m × 5.09m\r\nSpacious front reception room with a bay window, fireplace and fitted shelving.\r\n\r\nKitchen — 3.88m × 4.79m\r\nBright kitchen with a central island, opening into the dining area.\r\n\r\nDining Area — 2.46m × 4.80m\r\nGenerous dining space overlooking the rear garden, with direct access outside.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\nSeparate utility room adjoining the kitchen, with external access.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\nConveniently located off the utility room.\r\n\r\nIntegrated Garage — 2.95m × 4.57m\r\nAdditional storage space, currently arranged as a home gym.\r\n\r\nFirst-Floor Landing\r\nProviding access to four bedrooms and the family bathroom.\r\n\r\nPrincipal Bedroom — 3.45m × 4.39m\r\nSpacious front bedroom featuring a bay window and private en suite.\r\n\r\nEn Suite — 3.12m × 1.39m\r\nLocated off the principal bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 — 3.12m × 3.29m\r\nRear-facing bedroom overlooking the garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 — 3.14m × 2.41m\r\nRear-facing bedroom, also suitable as a home office.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 — 2.81m × 2.87m\r\nFront-facing bedroom.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom — 2.12m × 2.28m\r\nSeparate family bathroom with a side window.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nFront driveway providing off-street parking. Spacious rear garden with a lawn and decked seating area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• Four-bedroom semi-detached home\r\n• Spacious living room with bay window and fireplace\r\n• Open-plan kitchen and dining area with garden access\r\n• Kitchen with central island\r\n• Separate utility room with external access\r\n• Family bathroom and ground-floor guest WC\r\n• Integrated garage, currently used as a home gym\r\n• Rear garden with lawn and decked seating area\r\n• Off-street parking"
      },
